meta {
  name: 06 Lab Order All Reports PDF
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/patient-portal/lab-orders/{{patientLabOrderId}}/reports.pdf
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{patientAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  All of the order's PUBLISHED reports as one merged PDF (`application/pdf`, served
  inline; binary, so no JSON envelope). Uses the branch's QR-scan report template
  when one is configured.

  Errors (JSON envelope):
  - `404 PATIENT_LAB_ORDER_NOT_FOUND` — the order is not in the patient's scope
  - `404 PATIENT_REPORT_NOT_AVAILABLE` — nothing is published yet
  - `403 PATIENT_REPORT_NOT_AVAILABLE` — cancelled order, or the lab's rules withhold
    the report (for example a referrer's credit restriction). The message is always
    the neutral "Report not available. Please contact the lab." — the lab's private
    figures are never returned.
  - `503 PATIENT_REPORT_NOT_AVAILABLE` — the lab has no usable print template

  The client must fetch this with the Authorization header (a plain link cannot).
}
